#: includes/class-rnrd-welcome.php:842
msgid "Make your site readable by ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity and Google AI. Start with your brand: these four fields feed every AI surface RankReady controls. The panel alongside shows where each one is used and previews your /llms.txt as you type."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-rnrd-welcome.php:855
msgid "The canonical brand name. Used as the Organization entity name in schema, llms.txt and every generated summary. Leave blank to fall back to the WordPress site title."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-rnrd-welcome.php:873
msgid "A single sentence that describes the brand. Shows up under the brand name in /llms.txt and in every summary RankReady generates. Max 160 characters."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-rnrd-welcome.php:881
msgid "Example: A 5-minute Pomodoro timer for Mac that hides your distracting apps automatically."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-rnrd-welcome.php:887
msgid "About (optional)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-rnrd-welcome.php:890
msgid "Detailed context that goes into your llms.txt, so an AI crawler reads who the site is for: audience, differentiators, proof. Markdown supported. Max 500 characters."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-rnrd-welcome.php:898
msgid "Example: We help solo Mac users stay focused without forcing them into a calendar. Built since 2022, used by 12,000+ freelancers and indie devs. Featured in The Verge and Lifehacker."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-rnrd-welcome.php:907
msgid "One canonical name per line, exact capitalisation and spacing. Include product names, frequent misspellings, abbreviations. RankReady then writes the canonical form everywhere it publishes your name, so a crawler sees one spelling instead of five."
